tle=\"2005 PMWC Problems/Problem T7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_T9\" title=\"2005 PMWC Problems/Problem T9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_T10\" title=\"2005 PMWC Problems/Problem T10\">10</a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017084400\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.026 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.044 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 111/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1654/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 124/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1877/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   10.491      1 Template:PMWC_box\n100.00%   10.491      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:5497:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017084400 and revision id 113993. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}